on of Interdisciplinary Design S Sage Sidley Regular Part-Time Faculty Division of Fine Arts Sam Decoste Regular Part-Time Faculty Divisions of Media Arts, Animation & Art History and Contemporary Culture Sam Fisher Professor Division of Media Arts, Film Division Chair (July 1, 2022 - June 30, 2026) Sara Hartland-Rowe Regular Part-Time Faculty Division of Fine Arts, Painting Sarah Maloney Regular Part-Time Faculty Foundation and Division of Fine Arts, Sculpture Scott W. Sinclair Regular Part-Time Faculty Division of Design Sheila Provazza Regular Part-Time Faculty Division of Fine Arts, Painting Solomon Nagler Professor Division of Media Arts, Film Steve Farmer Regular Part-Time Faculty Division of Media Arts, Photography Steve Higgins Regular Part-Time Faculty Division of Fine Arts T Tabitha Osler Regular Part-Time Faculty Division of Craft Takashi Hilferink Technician Fine Arts, Painting and Drawing Tamsin Sloots Technician Craft, Fashion Tara Mills Regular Part-Time Faculty Division of Foundation U Ufuk Ali Gueray ASSISTANT PROFESSOR DIVISION OF FINE ARTS, PAINTING V Dr. Vajdon Sohaili Assistant Professor Division of Art History and Contemporary Culture Ven Cain Library Technician Véronique MacKenzie Regular Part-Time Faculty Division of Media Arts, Expanded Media W William Robinson Technician Learning Commons, Multimedia CONNECT Talk with a recruiter VIRTUAL VISIT Academic calendar Apply to NSCAD 5163 Duke Street Halifax, NS B3J 3J6 Canada +1 902.444.9600 +1 902.425.2420 info@nscad.ca Land Acknowledgement NSCAD University is located in Kjipuktuk, the district of Sipekne’katik, Mi’kma’ki, which since time immemorial, has been the unceded traditional territory and ancestral homelands of the Mi’kmaq Nation. In Nova Scotia, we recognize we are all Treaty People. Read our Land Acknowledgement. NSCAD acknowledges the historical and contemporary presence of people of African descent. African Nova Scotians have existed and persisted on the traditional land of the Mi’kmaq for more than 400 years. Read our People’s Acknowledgement. Contact us Important dates Explore careers Access & Privacy Security Follow us Instagram Facebook Linkedin"
