      "description": "Financial Services Officer - Accounts Payable | careerbeacon.com Financial Services Officer - Accounts Payable NSCAD University | Halifax, Nova Scotia, Canada View job description Application Questions Review How would you like to start? Select one of our quick apply options. Import Resume Previous Application Apply Manually Loading... Import Options Contact Information * First name * Last name * Email address * Phone number * Location Education Add your educational experience below. Add Education Work Experience Describe all related work experience below. Add Experience Languages Add the languages you are fluent in. Language Afrikanns Albanian Arabic Armenian Aymara Basque Bengali Bosnian Bulgarian Cambodian Cantonese Catalan Chechen Chinese (Mandarin) Corsican Croation Czech Danish Dutch Dzongkha English Esperanto Estonian Fiji Finnish French Frisian Galician Georgian German Greek Gujarati Hausa Hawaiian Hebrew Hindi Hungarian Icelandic Indonesian Irish Italian Japanese Javanese Korean Kurdish Lao Latin Latvian Lithuanian Luxembourgish Macedonian Malagasy Malay Malayalam Maltese Maori Marathi Mongolian Nepali Norwegian Pashto Persian Polish Portuguese Punjabi Quechua Romanian Russian Samoan Sanskrit Serbian Slovak Slovenian Somali Spanish Swahili Swedish Tagalog Tajik Tamil Tatar Telugu Thai Tibetan Tonga Tswana Turkish Turkmen Ukranian Urdu Uyghur Uzbek Vietnamese Welsh Wolof Xhosa Yiddish Zulu English Core Skills Select the core skills you possess that make you a great fit for this job. Additional Skills (Optional) Add any additional skills you possess that you feel are related to this position. Add Online Presence (Optional) If you are interested, you can share your online presence with the employer. Choose... LinkedIn Facebook Twitter Google+ Tumblr Dribbble GitHub Bitbucket AngelList YouTube Instagram Medium Reddit Vimeo Pinterest Flickr Other Website Other Website Add URL Highlights (Optional) Describe your most marketable strengths and talents. Limit to 600 characters. Rich Text Editor, highlights Editor toolbars Basic Styles Bold Keyboard shortcut Command+B Italic Keyboard shortcut Command+I Paragraph Insert/Remove Numbered List Insert/Remove Bulleted List Decrease Indent Increase Indent Align Left Center Align Right Justify Links Link Keyboard shortcut Command+L Unlink about About CKEditor 4 Words: 0, Characters: 0/600 Cover Letter (Optional) Choose an option below. Both choices are valued equally. Write Cover Letter Attach Cover Letter Rich Text Editor, cover_letter Editor toolbars Basic Styles Bold Keyboard shortcut Command+B Italic Keyboard shortcut Command+I Paragraph Insert/Remove Numbered List Insert/Remove Bulleted List Decrease Indent Increase Indent Align Left Center Align Right Justify Links Link Keyboard shortcut Command+L Unlink about About CKEditor 4 Cover Letter Options * Resume/CV Attach Resume/CV Attachments (Optional) Attach documents that support your application (i.e., transcript or portfolio work) Upload Document Save and Continue Assistant Welcome to your job application! Remember always to put your best foot forward. Be as thorough as possible in the information you provide. Need clarification on something? Just check out the tips I offer you along the way. Tips Contact Information Education Work Experience Languages Core Skills Additional Skills Online Presence Highlights Cover Letter Resume/CV Contact Information I admit this is pretty self-explanatory. But, I do want to remind you to double check your phone number and email address. A tiny mistake could have big implications! Return to tips Education This is where you add all relevant education experience you wish to share. In the description, be sure to add what courses you excelled in and what projects you completed which were really cool. Return to tips Work Experience It’s necessary to share work experience related to the job you are applying for. In the description, be sure to highlight what your major accomplishments were in each previous role. This gives the employer insight into what your responsibilities were and what you are capable of. Use this section to detail any relevant volunteer experience as well. Return to tips Languages Pretty simple. Just select the languages in which you have a working proficiency. Easy peasy. Return to tips Core Skills Mindfully select the skills that help you perform at your best. Core skills are a way for employers to understand you so they can make informed decisions. So be honest ;) Return to tips Additional Skills Have more skills to share? Do it here! Return to tips Online Presence Perhaps you have a stellar blog or a great LinkedIn profile. Share the links here for the employer to explore. Return to tips Highlights The Highlights section appears at the very top of your application. It’s pretty important, so make it count! Highlight key achievements, mention things that stand out about you as a person and your experiences, and if you can, give them a bit of insight into your personality. Help them remember you. You’re amazing, so tell them. Return to tips Cover Letter If you choose Write Cover Letter, you can write it right here in the application. Or you can attach your cover letter (PDF recommended). Return to tips Resume/CV Here you can attach your resume. Attaching your resume here will not overwrite any other info you’ve already imported. We recommend you upload your resume as a PDF file. File types: .pdf,.docx,.doc,.rtf,.txt,.odt Maximum file size is 20 MB. Return to tips Attachments Some employers want to see more. Be sure to check the application to see if they request any additional documentation. Maximum file size is 20 MB. Return to tips Sorry, but it looks like you've missed something. Return to tips Need more help? Uploading file, please wait... Cancel upload × Error: The resume uploaded couldn't be imported properly. Our system only accepts certain file types (.doc, .docx, .pdf for example). If you can convert your file to one of these file types, we should be able to import all of your information. If you experience any issues, you can email us at support@careerbeacon.com . Close Window Log in to your Alongside Account Wrong Username/Email and password combination. Sorry, but it looks like you've already applied for this position. Email address (success) Password (success) Login Forgot Password? SOCIAL LOGIN Login with Facebook Login with LinkedIn Login with Google Close Which profile would you like to use? Sorry, but it looks like you've already applied for this position. Default \n                                  | Last applied position: None Default \n                                  | Last applied position: None"
    }
  },
